3000
02:14:46,282 --> 02:14:49,282
平日お仕事 学校だったお主らはお疲れ様！
good job to everyone who had work or school on weekdays!

3001
02:14:49,782 --> 02:14:51,782
1週間お疲れ様なんのじゃ
Good work on getting through the week!

3002
02:14:51,782 --> 02:14:54,782
また次は日曜日かな？
Next up will be Sunday, I guess?

3003
02:14:54,782 --> 02:14:56,282
